Package: forestPulse
Type: Package
Title: Analyse Forest Structure and Disturbance from Field and Remote Sensing Data
Version: 0.2.5
Authors@R: person(given = "Sushil", family = "Paudel", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "clarkesushi@gmail.com")
Description: Analyse forest structure and disturbance dynamics from field
    measurements and remote-sensing imagery. Functions index geotagged
    rasters into a spatial catalog matched to field plots, compute canopy
    height models and canopy gap geometry, derive RGB vegetation indices,
    locate trees from compass bearings, and summarise plot-level basal
    area, crown density, and species composition.
